      "portrait": "1980s Hong Kong horror comic style (港漫) halftone screen-print illustration, half-length portrait of a 38-year-old Chinese man, Republic-era Guangdong 1929, a rural security captain, round face, thin moustache, slightly heavy build, peaked cap, khaki security uniform with leather belt and a holstered Mauser pistol, forced confident expression with uneasy eyes, jade-green moonlight with talisman yellow and blood-red accents",
